# Java Comparison

| Concept             | Java                 |
| ------------------- | -------------------- |
| Sorted + Unique     | `TreeSet`            |
| Sorted + Duplicates | `TreeMap<E,Integer>` |
| Unordered + Unique  | `HashSet`            |
| Sorted              | `TreeSet`, `TreeMap` |
| Unordered           | `HashSet`            |
| Duplicates          | TreeMap frequency    |
| Fast average lookup | `HashSet`            |

---

# Python Comparison

| Concept                      | Python        |
| ---------------------------- | ------------- |
| Unique values                | `set`         |
| Duplicate values + frequency | `Counter`     |
| Sorted unique values         | `sorted(set)` |
| Unordered unique values      | `set`         |
| Frequency                    | `Counter`     |

